{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8989AA71","title":"Clem Questions","entry":"Dlg_8989AA71::entry","exit":"Dlg_8989AA71::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_CC15ADD4","articyId":"72057611217986776","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Ha, you sound like a street racer with a HOVA. You can buy new modules for different crops. Or upgrade the ones you have for faster growing and better yields. But that costs Lims.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha, you sound like a street racer with a HOVA. You can buy new modules for different crops. Or upgrade the ones you have for faster growing and better yields. But that costs Lims.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39399","byteOffset":29235464,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_E1029685","articyId":"72057611217986797","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"There are hardware vendors all over the LUZ, and a few right here in the Docks. But why rush? No harm in growing slow.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There are hardware vendors all over the LUZ, and a few right here in the Docks. But why rush? No harm in growing slow.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3650.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44011","byteOffset":30984704,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_A6F9FACA","articyId":"72057611217986823","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"I've been doing it my whole life. My family were algae farmers in the Ventz. Once you can grow crustgrass at negative five in a steam geyser, you can grow most things.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've been doing it my whole life. My family were algae farmers in the Ventz. Once you can grow crustgrass at negative five in a steam geyser, you can grow most things.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29131","byteOffset":18901784,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_1499BE07","articyId":"72057611217986850","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"No, they... were caught in a Big Chill. I only survived because I was making a delivery up here. If it wasn't for Thaddeus, I would have starved.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, they... were caught in a Big Chill. I only survived because I was making a delivery up here. If it wasn't for Thaddeus, I would have starved.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38363","byteOffset":28847712,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_739179E5","articyId":"72057611217986864","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Sure, who didn't?","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure, who didn't?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4550.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45689","byteOffset":31616840,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_CF32F18D","articyId":"72057611217986898","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"No. But he'd be glad to know you're looking after things. Anyway, come back and talk to me again some time. I might have something for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. But he'd be glad to know you're looking after things. Anyway, come back and talk to me again some time. I might have something for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5450.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24832","byteOffset":17274072,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_97641CC6","articyId":"72057611217986946","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Hey! How are your first onions?","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey! How are your first onions?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29176","byteOffset":18919240,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_FA7561B1","articyId":"72057611218064906","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"They'll take a little while to grow. You should try to stop by the greenhouse every day to plant and harvest crops. And check the parameters.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They'll take a little while to grow. You should try to stop by the greenhouse every day to plant and harvest crops. And check the parameters.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35245","byteOffset":25694440,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_7815CA29","articyId":"72057611218064981","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Yeah, humidity, temperature and light. You can set them via the module in the greenhouse. Different crops have different needs, but your settings apply to the whole place.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, humidity, temperature and light. You can set them via the module in the greenhouse. Different crops have different needs, but your settings apply to the whole place.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19514","byteOffset":15267168,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_5B2D598D","articyId":"72057611218065042","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Not everything is about profit, hotshot. But come back and talk to me again some time. I might have something for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not everything is about profit, hotshot. But come back and talk to me again some time. I might have something for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4550.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44205","byteOffset":31057544,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_899205A2","articyId":"72057611218106753","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"De nada. Come back and talk to me again some time. I might have something for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"De nada. Come back and talk to me again some time. I might have something for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4550.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45607","byteOffset":31585640,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_71FE86A6","articyId":"72057821671327058","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"He gave me my first packet of onion seeds. Carminus Reds. The same ones I gave you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He gave me my first packet of onion seeds. Carminus Reds. The same ones I gave you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42892","byteOffset":30556840,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_54A4E144","articyId":"72057611217986754","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do I upgrade my greenhouse?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do I upgrade my greenhouse?","TextSheVersion":"How do I upgrade my greenhouse?","TextTheyVersion":"How do I upgrade my greenhouse?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35800","byteOffset":27891152,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_A9FDF244","articyId":"72057611217986790","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Where can I buy them?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Where can I buy them?","TextSheVersion":"Where can I buy them?","TextTheyVersion":"Where can I buy them?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22888","byteOffset":16543344,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_F622FAF6","articyId":"72057611217986813","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You know a lot about gardening.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVers